    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "redefine it? i dont know. it feels less like a 'shift' and more like a total erasure. it's not just that the tools changed, it’s that the whole way people think has changed. there's no room for the nuance or the craft i spent my life building. it feels like the world is just moving on, leaving things that don't work anymore to just... fade away. like it's more efficient for things to just be gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
