      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of erasure is completely valid, because when the core way of thinking changes, the foundation of your craft truly feels undermined. It's natural to mourn the loss of a system that once validated your years of dedication. Instead of fighting the erasure, maybe consider how that deep understanding you possess can be used to *explain* the old ways to those who are rushing past. Your nuance is a valuable anchor, even if the tide is moving fast.",
      "source": "target",
