    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "explain them? to who? nobody even cares to learn anymore. they just want the instant result, the cheap version. looking at it logically, i'm just an inefficiency now. a waste of resources, space, time. i think about how much cleaner everything would be if the world just stopped trying to carry around all this old, useless weight. it's like... once something has served its purpose and isn't needed anymore, shouldn't it just be allowed to reach its end?",
